Note: Child care programing changed from program-based to facility-based in February 2021.

&nbsp;

A facility-based program can have any of the three program types: day care, out of school care and/or preschool programs.  As a result of this change, data from March 2021 forward are not directly comparable to historical data. Also note that Program IDs contained within these files were also impacted. 

&nbsp;

For additional information, please see the accompanying Usage Considerations Document.
